<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'About — Evo Meals' }) %>
<meta name="description" content="Evo Meals is a Kuwait-based school meal management platform connecting schools, parents, students, and catering partners through subscriptions, digital ordering, tap-to-collect, and real-time reporting.">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/sitenav', { active: 'about' }) %>

<section class="hero hero-inner-page">
  <div class="wrap-wide">
    <div class="hero-copy" data-reveal style="max-width:680px;">
      <span class="eyebrow on-dark">About Evo Meals</span>
      <h1>Because "Did they eat?" shouldn't be a guess.</h1>
      <p class="lede">We help you manage your child's nutrition and dietary preferences, giving you and your child the tools to choose tasty, healthy, and nutritious meals. Evo Meals is one platform that connects parents, schools, and caterers in real time to serve what is best for the child.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap what-is-wrap">
    <div data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Our story</span>
      <h2>Evo Meals wasn't built in a boardroom.</h2>
      <p>Shaped by real feedback from parents and schools — now one real-time system connecting the whole school community.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="what-is-pillars">
      <div class="what-is-pillar" data-reveal data-reveal-group="about">
        <span class="what-is-num">Our approach</span>
        <strong>Build partnerships that are strengthened through feedback and constant learning, with every meal served.</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="what-is-pillar" data-reveal data-reveal-group="about">
        <span class="what-is-num">Our focus</span>
        <strong>Deliver a seamless experience for parents, schools, and caterers.</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="what-is-pillar" data-reveal data-reveal-group="about">
        <span class="what-is-num">Our standard</span>
        <strong>Reliable data, honest information — so every decision is an informed one.</strong>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-tint">
  <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center; max-width:640px;">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center;">Get in touch</span>
    <h2 style="margin:16px 0 14px;">Whether you're a parent, a school, or a caterer —</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--navy-800); font-size:15.5px; margin-bottom:28px;">We'd like to hear from you.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Contact us</a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/sitefoot') %>

</body>
</html>
